# Bump this file in a pull request after changing a GitHub secret that feeds
# this root, such as PROD_MCC_EMAIL_DOMAIN or PROD_MCC_EMAIL_ALIAS. The change
# makes Terrateam plan infrastructure/prod/foundation, so the new value is
# applied only after review.
# Add one line with the date and the reason. Never write the value or a hash of it.
2026-10-14 Email domain read from the PROD_MCC_EMAIL_DOMAIN repository secret.
2026-10-14 Email alias read from the PROD_MCC_EMAIL_ALIAS repository secret.
